{
    "type": "errors",
    "wrapper": "errors",
    "strict_fields": true,
    "notes": [
        "Transcribed from the backend app's ErrorsBatchController (validator rules plus ALLOWED_ERROR_FIELDS), verified 2026-08-19; the legacy laravel_version spelling was removed from the allow-list on 2026-08-21.",
        "This is the only type with a strict allow-list: an item carrying any key outside `fields` is rejected, and one rejected item takes the whole batch down with a 422. The retired Laravel SDK spelling `laravel_version` is such a key now: it was tolerated at ingest while deployed SDKs still sent it, and both SDKs ship the generic framework pair.",
        "The canonical SDK shape is the 19 keys in `fields`, all always present, nullable ones sent as null. The `minimal` example is what the app accepts, not what any SDK sends.",
        "The `full` example populates every field at once so a consumer exercises every rule in one POST. No single SDK run produces it: `headers`, `url` and `method` are null in a console context and `console_command`, `console_arguments` are null in a web context. The `console` example shows the real console shape."
    ],
    "fields": {
        "message": {
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 10000
        },
        "file": {
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 1000
        },
        "line": {
            "required": true,
            "type": "integer"
        },
        "type": {
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 255
        },
        "environment": {
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 50
        },
        "timestamp": {
            "required": true,
            "type": "date"
        },
        "trace": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 5000
        },
        "headers": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "array",
            "max": 50
        },
        "headers.*": {
            "type": "array"
        },
        "headers.*.*": {
            "type": "string",
            "max": 500
        },
        "context": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 30000
        },
        "highlight_line": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer"
        },
        "user": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "array"
        },
        "user.*": {
            "required": false
        },
        "url": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 2000
        },
        "method": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
                "GET",
                "POST",
                "PUT",
                "PATCH",
                "DELETE",
                "HEAD",
                "OPTIONS"
            ]
        },
        "php_version": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 20
        },
        "framework": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 50
        },
        "framework_version": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 50
        },
        "is_console": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "boolean"
        },
        "console_command": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "max": 1000
        },
        "console_arguments": {
            "required": false,
            "type": "array",
            "max": 50
        },
        "console_arguments.*": {
            "type": "string",
            "max": 500
        }
    },
    "examples": {
